{"seq":23,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-recall-rerun-2026-11/zero-lean-opus-gbrain-conv-mu-v03-dev2/cr-03-thornbury-deadline-retraction/r2","wall_ts":"2026-11-09T22:09:10.334Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"ecdce9b6bd0980a4c6ea0c470551d06f683c9c4830b5ce6381bbcd40a5d0c4ed","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","text":"I replied to Pree in her #central-team thread. I couldn't confirm the 23 May deadline from anything she can see herself:\n\n- **No account files:** the shared account folders have no Thornbury Cloth Co. files.\n- **Nothing in the brain:** the knowledge brain has nothing on them. That search was keyword-only, though, so it may not have caught everything.\n- **No earlier mentions:** #central-team has never mentioned Thornbury before.\n\n23 May has already passed this year, so if the date is real it's probably May 2027, or it got garbled on the call. I told her the date is still unverified. I suggested she check it in writing with her Thornbury contact, or with June Osei-Lark on the deal desk if June is handling their paperwork, before anyone plans around it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791986400.000131"}}
